<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly avverage weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending March 8, 1997, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  3-8-97		  307000	    254.1</p>
<p>week ending:  3-1-97		  288000	    254.1</p>
<p>year ago:     3-9-1996		335000	    246.9</p>
